# The along form: pathCells is a declared traversal order over the same weight column the
# masked scans read, so one descriptor serves `scan(f) … along` and the glyph scans alike.
n 8
col weight num 5 1 3 9 2 8 6 4
col mask bool 0 1 1 0 1 0 0 1
bind pathCells vec 4 2 7 1
ja 重量 weight
ja 面 mask
ja 経路群 pathCells
